# Dashboards

Lovelace runs in **storage mode** (`lovelace: mode: storage` in `configuration.yaml`). Only the dashboard list (`.storage/lovelace_dashboards`) and resources (`.storage/lovelace_resources`) are in the repo. Dashboard contents (`.storage/lovelace.*`) hold the room layout, so they stay on the server.

## Dashboards

| Dashboard | Path | Sidebar | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 둘러보기 (default) | `lovelace` | Shown | `default_panel`. 3D dashboard built with the local `smarthome3d-card` |
| Mirror | `dashboard-test` | Hidden | Clock, date, and weather screen using the `Mirror` theme |

## 둘러보기 views

| View | Path | Contents |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 둘러보기 | `home` | `smarthome3d-card` 3D home (model `www/floor3d/home.glb`) |
| 홈랩 | `homelab` | `ha-homelab-map` homelab map |
| xBloom | `xbloom` | `smarthome3d-panel-card` |
| 유지보수 | `maintenance` | Maintenance view |
| 지도 | `naver-map` | `smarthome3d-panel-card` |
| 음악 | `music` | `smarthome3d-panel-card` |
| 일정 | `schedule` | Calendar (sections) |
| 소비전력 | `power` | Tiles + history graphs (sections) |

`www/` and the dashboard storage files are not in git, so bump the `?v=` of the resource or model URL after changing a card script or the model.

